@startuml
title BrewLite - Sơ đồ triển khai môi trường Production (Assignment 2)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Người dùng / Barista\n(Trình duyệt / Mobile PWA)" as user

cloud "Internet công cộng" as internet

node "GitHub Actions (CI/CD - Node 24)" as ci {
  component "CI Pipeline (ci.yml)\nLint -> Unit Test (API & Web) -> Build" as ci_pipe
  component "CD Pipeline (cd.yml)\nQuality Gate -> Build -> GHCR Push -> Deploy -> Smoke Test" as cd_pipe
}

node "GitHub Container Registry (ghcr.io)" as registry {
  artifact "Image: brewlite-api\n(tags: SHA, latest, v*.*.*)" as img_api
  artifact "Image: brewlite-web\n(tags: SHA, latest, v*.*.*)" as img_web
}

node "Vercel (Web Hosting & Edge CDN)\nswe-project-assignment2.vercel.app" as web {
  component "Frontend Next.js 16 (Node 24)\nRoutes: /, /products/[id], /cart,\n/orders, /orders/[id], /staff, ..." as next
}

node "Render Cloud PaaS (API Service)\nbrewlite-api-2tuk.onrender.com" as api {
  component "API NestJS (Container :8080)\nHTTPS :443 -> HTTP :8080\nHealth: GET /health | Swagger: /swagger" as nest
  artifact "Environment Secrets\nPORT, DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET,\nPAYMENT_PROVIDER, VNPAY_TMN_CODE, VNPAY_HASH_SECRET" as secrets
}

database "Render Managed PostgreSQL 16\n(Lưu trữ bền vững & Backup)" as db {
  component "CSDL PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM & Migration)" as postgres
}

cloud "Cổng thanh toán bên ngoài\nVNPay Sandbox (HMAC-SHA512)\nhoặc Mock Payment Adapter" as payment

' Luồng CI/CD & Container Registry
ci_pipe ..> cd_pipe : Bảo vệ nhánh main (PR Quality Gate)
cd_pipe --> registry : Docker Buildx Push\n(brewlite-api & brewlite-web)
registry ..> api : Docker Image (Node 24)
registry ..> web : Docker Image (Node 24)
cd_pipe ..> api : Deploy Webhook & Smoke Test\n(/health, /swagger, --smoke)
cd_pipe ..> web : Deploy & Smoke Check (HTTP 200)

' Luồng người dùng & runtime production
user --> internet : HTTPS
internet --> web : HTTPS :443
web --> api : HTTPS REST API\n(CORS + JWT Bearer)
api --> db : TLS / Mạng nội bộ :5432
api --> payment : HTTPS (Checkout URL)
payment ..> api : IPN & Return Callback\n(/payments/vnpay/ipn, /return)
api ..> secrets : Đọc khi khởi động

note right of web
Production Frontend (Vercel):
- Edge CDN phục vụ static + SSR
- Chỉ nhận biến công khai NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
- Không chứa DB URL hay Secret thanh toán
end note

note right of api
Production API (Render :8080):
- Health Check: GET /health (HTTP 200)
- Lệnh dọn đơn quá hạn mỗi 15s (cửa sổ 10 phút)
- Tự khởi động lại khi lỗi
end note

note bottom of registry
Quản lý Image bất biến trên GHCR:
- Đẩy tự động cho cả brewlite-api và brewlite-web
- Gắn tag commit SHA, latest và tag release v*.*.*
end note

note bottom of db
PostgreSQL 16 được quản lý:
- Chạy prisma migrate deploy trước khi khởi chạy
- Không mở cổng DB ra Internet công cộng
end note

legend
  == Phân tách môi trường ==
  Local: Docker Compose (db:5432, backend:8080, frontend:3000) chạy qua localhost.
  CI/CD & Registry: GitHub Actions (Node 24) tự động test, build, đẩy image lên ghcr.io & chạy smoke test.
  Production: Vercel (Web) + Render (API :8080 & Managed PostgreSQL) + VNPay Sandbox / Mock Payment.
endlegend
@enduml
